Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libicu74 | libicu76 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libsqlite3-0
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: standalone book library manager and download automation server
 BookshelfNG manages authors and books, monitors libraries and indexers, and
 automates book downloads. It runs as a local web application and supports
 optional runtime metadata catalogs.
